{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Flowery — the golden flower\n\nLeader of the 7 Colored Flowers; main antagonist and final boss of Ch.5. Undertale counterpart to Flowey.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Ralsei**\nHis declared archrival — mutual jealousy, but underlying respect.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nThe center of everything he does: he wants to return the affection he received over the years.","x":346,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nConfronts them to protect Asgore — it costs them their life.","x":164,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nKnows they created the Fountain and accuses them of putting Asgore at risk.","x":-424,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Aqua** (Patience) **and Seth** (Perseverance)\nThe first two flowers of the Garden — knives and books.","x":-606,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"4"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Orange** (Bravery) **and Green** (Kindness)\nThe Castle's little mouse and the flowers' chef.","x":900,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"4"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Yellow** (Justice) **and Blue** (Integrity)\nThe gullible cowboy and the dancer — implied couple.","x":900,"y":400,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"4"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flowery_battle_idle.gif","x":-986,"y":-79,"width":177,"height":190},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flowery_screenshot_faith_in_Ralsei.png","x":-129,"y":-938,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flowery_screenshot_Asgore_bestfriend.png","x":710,"y":-354,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flowery_and_Knight_battle_clash.gif","x":416,"y":563,"width":260,"height":178},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/kriss_flowery.png","x":-670,"y":559,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s_semillas_codigo","type":"text","text":"**The Seeds and the Shelter code**\nWhen sealing the Flower Kingdom's Fountain in Ch.5, Kris finds a packet of Seeds with danger warnings and the Shelter code, buried in Flowery's broken pot — they can't be put down once picked up, a direct nod to Undertale's golden flower seeds, which the fandom links to Chara's attempt. No official confirmation of their real purpose.","x":-986,"y":829,"width":320,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_codigo_0915","type":"text","text":"**What does the code \"0915199X\" mean?**\n\"0915\" seems to nod to Undertale's release date (9/15); the final \"X\" leaves the year unconfirmed, which fuels the parallel theory that it's the date of Asgore and Toriel's wedding. The first is nearly confirmed by design; the second is only fan theory.","x":-646,"y":829,"width":320,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_quien_es_pink","type":"text","text":"**Pink isn't one of the original 7**\nActs like just another flower in the group (Orange calls her \"big sister\"), but she isn't one of the 7 Flowers from Asgore and Toriel's bouquet — her real identity is confirmed in her own note.","x":-306,"y":829,"width":320,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_flowey_ralsei","type":"text","text":"**Is \"We could have been friends\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] a nod to Undertale?**\nVery likely: Ralsei is a confirmed mirror of Asriel, and Flowery a direct allusion to Flowey — in Undertale, Flowey and Asriel are the same person; Deltarune splits that idea into two characters who clash. Flowery's line could be almost a metatextual comment on that duality.","x":34,"y":829,"width":320,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_semillas_codigo-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/flowery_shelter_code_scene.webp","x":-986,"y":619,"width":220,"height":180},{"id":"s_flowey_ralsei-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/asriel_ralsei_fire_atack.jpeg","x":34,"y":619,"width":220,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Seth_and_Aqua_battle_dance.gif","x":-899,"y":-316,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Blue_and_Yellow_overworld_turnaround_hug.gif","x":1260,"y":542,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s_quien_es_pink-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mad_Mew_Mew_Pink.gif","x":-301,"y":1194,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s_semillas_codigo","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_semillas_codigo","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_codigo_0915","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_codigo_0915","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_quien_es_pink","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_quien_es_pink","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_flowey_ralsei","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_flowey_ralsei","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_semillas_codigo-img","fromNode":"s_semillas_codigo-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_semillas_codigo","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_flowey_ralsei-img","fromNode":"s_flowey_ralsei-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_flowey_ralsei","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_quien_es_pink-img","fromNode":"s_quien_es_pink-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_quien_es_pink","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"}]}